#. spellPatterns.star-orbit.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:8
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.star-orbit.name"
msgid "Stardust Orbit"
msgstr "星屑軌道"

#. spellPatterns.star-orbit.premise
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:9
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.star-orbit.premise"
msgid ""
"Star rings expand from the centre. The promise is clear; the second ring "
"rarely obeys the first."
msgstr "由中心向外展開的星環；承諾很清楚，第二圈通常不肯照第一圈的意思走。"

#. spellPatterns.amulet-fan.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:15
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.amulet-fan.name"
msgid "Ofuda Fan Gate"
msgstr "御札扇門"

#. spellPatterns.amulet-fan.premise
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:16
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.amulet-fan.premise"
msgid ""
"A fan of shots leaves several gates after declaration. Reimu and the "
"designer often disagree on whether they count as exits."
msgstr "扇形彈幕在宣言後留下數道門；門夠不夠算退路，靈夢與設計者往往意見不同。"

#. spellPatterns.frozen-lattice.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:22
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.frozen-lattice.name"
msgid "Frozen Lattice"
msgstr "凍結格子"

#. spellPatterns.frozen-lattice.premise
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:23
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.frozen-lattice.premise"
msgid ""
"Orderly ice rows stop, then shift. Reading the lattice is easy; remembering "
"where it just was is harder."
msgstr "整齊的冰晶列先停住、再換位；看懂格子不難，記得它剛才在哪裡比較難。"

#. spellPatterns.wind-corridor.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:29
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.wind-corridor.name"
msgid "Wind-Cut Gallery"
msgstr "風切回廊"

#. spellPatterns.wind-corridor.premise
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:30
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.wind-corridor.premise"
msgid ""
"Crossing wind shots push the safe gallery sideways. The clearest audience "
"angle is usually not the participant's."
msgstr "兩側風彈交錯，把安全走廊推著移動；觀眾看得最清楚的角度通常不在參與者那邊。"

#. spellPatterns.boundary-fold.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:36
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.boundary-fold.name"
msgid "Boundary Foldback"
msgstr "境界折返"

#. spellPatterns.boundary-fold.premise
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:37
msgctxt "text:spellPatterns.boundary-fold.premise"
msgid ""
"Shots leaving one edge return from the other. Without version and direction "
"marks, they excel at pretending they never left."
msgstr "離場的彈幕從另一側回來；若沒有留下版本和方向標記，它也很擅長假裝自己從未離場。"

#. spellVenues.hakurei-yard.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:44
msgctxt "text:spellVenues.hakurei-yard.name"
msgid "Hakurei Shrine Stone Yard"
msgstr "博麗神社石庭"

#. spellVenues.hakurei-yard.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:45
msgctxt "text:spellVenues.hakurei-yard.note"
msgid "Open ground; the visitor path may not be reclassified as a safe corridor."
msgstr "場地開闊；香客動線不能被臨時算成安全走廊。"

#. spellVenues.misty-lake-bank.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:50
msgctxt "text:spellVenues.misty-lake-bank.name"
msgid "Misty Lake Shore Stage"
msgstr "霧湖岸邊舞台"

#. spellVenues.misty-lake-bank.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:51
msgctxt "text:spellVenues.misty-lake-bank.note"
msgid "Crosswind and lake glare can turn one beautiful cue into another."
msgstr "側風與水面反光會把漂亮的提示變成另一套提示。"

#. spellVenues.boundary-court.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:56
msgctxt "text:spellVenues.boundary-court.name"
msgid "Boundary Hall Demonstration Court"
msgstr "境界講堂試演場"

#. spellVenues.boundary-court.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:57
msgctxt "text:spellVenues.boundary-court.note"
msgid ""
"Return markers are clear, although the audience may occasionally occupy the "
"other side of the venue."
msgstr "回彈標記清楚，但觀眾席偶爾位於場地的另一側。"

#. spellVenues.bamboo-clearing.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:62
msgctxt "text:spellVenues.bamboo-clearing.name"
msgid "Moonlit Bamboo Clearing"
msgstr "迷途竹林月光空地"

#. spellVenues.bamboo-clearing.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:63
msgctxt "text:spellVenues.bamboo-clearing.note"
msgid "Low light reduces glare; bamboo shadows add an undeclared second layer."
msgstr "低照度減少眩光，竹影卻會替彈幕添加未申報的第二層。"

#. spellCues.ring-preview.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:71
msgctxt "text:spellCues.ring-preview.name"
msgid "Outline First"
msgstr "輪廓先行"

#. spellCues.ring-preview.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:72
msgctxt "text:spellCues.ring-preview.note"
msgid "Draw the whole outline before the first wave."
msgstr "第一波以前先畫出完整輪廓。"

#. spellCues.color-pulse.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:78
msgctxt "text:spellCues.color-pulse.name"
msgid "Two-Beat Colour Pulse"
msgstr "兩段色脈衝"

#. spellCues.color-pulse.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:79
msgctxt "text:spellCues.color-pulse.note"
msgid "Two colour changes signal direction; reflective venues may swallow the second."
msgstr "用兩次顏色變化提示方向；反光場地可能吃掉第二次。"

#. spellCues.freeze-trace.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:85
msgctxt "text:spellCues.freeze-trace.name"
msgid "Afterimage Trace"
msgstr "殘像軌跡"

#. spellCues.freeze-trace.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:86
msgctxt "text:spellCues.freeze-trace.note"
msgid "Keep a pale trace of the previous wave; at high density it becomes a very diligent lie."
msgstr "保留上一波的淡色路徑；高密度時會變成一張很努力的謊言。"

#. spellCues.declaration-only.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:92
msgctxt "text:spellCues.declaration-only.name"
msgid "Declaration Only"
msgstr "只靠口頭宣言"

#. spellCues.declaration-only.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:93
msgctxt "text:spellCues.declaration-only.note"
msgid "No second visual cue. Aya likes the headline; Reimu dislikes the incident report."
msgstr "畫面不給第二次提示；文喜歡標題，靈夢不喜歡事故報告。"

#. spellSounds.quiet.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:102
msgctxt "text:spellSounds.quiet.name"
msgid "No Added Sound Pressure"
msgstr "無附加音壓"

#. spellSounds.quiet.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:103
msgctxt "text:spellSounds.quiet.note"
msgid "Let the danmaku speak; the fairy chorus keeps its rehearsal rights."
msgstr "讓彈幕自己說話；妖精合唱團保留排練權。"

#. spellSounds.wood-chime.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:108
msgctxt "text:spellSounds.wood-chime.name"
msgid "Wooden Beat"
msgstr "木片節拍"

#. spellSounds.wood-chime.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:109
msgctxt "text:spellSounds.wood-chime.note"
msgid "One strike before every change; bad timing is worse than no cue."
msgstr "每次變化前敲一次；跑拍會比沒有提示更糟。"

#. spellSounds.temple-bell.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:114
msgctxt "text:spellSounds.temple-bell.name"
msgid "Small Temple Bell"
msgstr "小型鐘聲"

#. spellSounds.temple-bell.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:115
msgctxt "text:spellSounds.temple-bell.note"
msgid "Readable to the audience and to the class next door."
msgstr "觀眾聽得懂，隔壁課堂也聽得懂。"

#. spellSounds.kappa-metal.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:120
msgctxt "text:spellSounds.kappa-metal.name"
msgid "Kappa Metal Alarm"
msgstr "河童金屬警報"

#. spellSounds.kappa-metal.note
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:121
msgctxt "text:spellSounds.kappa-metal.note"
msgid "The machine never misses a change; few other sounds survive it."
msgstr "機械絕不會漏掉變化；其他聲音也很難留下。"

#. spellReviewers.reimu.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:129
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.reimu.name"
msgid "Reimu Hakurei"
msgstr "博麗靈夢"

#. spellReviewers.reimu.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:130
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.reimu.role"
msgid "Rules & exits"
msgstr "規則與退路"

#. spellReviewers.reimu.responses.approve
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:132
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.reimu.responses.approve"
msgid ""
"The rule arrives before the shots and the exit needs no guessing. Start it; "
"change things mid-pattern and I stop the match."
msgstr "規則先於彈幕出現，退路也不用猜。可以開始，再亂改我就停場。"

#. spellReviewers.reimu.responses.caution
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:133
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.reimu.responses.caution"
msgid ""
"I can see the gate. I am not sure it remains a gate until a slower "
"participant reaches it."
msgstr "我看得見門，但不確定慢的人到達以前它還是不是門。"

#. spellReviewers.reimu.responses.object
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:134
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.reimu.responses.object"
msgid "That is not an exit; it is empty space you can point at afterward. Write the rule first."
msgstr "這不是退路，只是一個事後能被指出來的空白。先把規則寫清楚。"

#. spellReviewers.marisa.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:139
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.marisa.name"
msgid "Marisa Kirisame"
msgstr "霧雨魔理沙"

#. spellReviewers.marisa.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:140
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.marisa.role"
msgid "Expression & reproducibility"
msgstr "表現力與重現"

#. spellReviewers.marisa.responses.approve
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:142
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.marisa.responses.approve"
msgid ""
"It has its own silhouette, and you wrote down the seed, speed, and venue. "
"That means the next one can be even louder."
msgstr "有自己的輪廓，而且把種子、速度和場地寫下來了。這才叫下次還能更華麗。"

#. spellReviewers.marisa.responses.caution
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:143
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.marisa.responses.caution"
msgid ""
"It looks good, but if you save only the best run, you are reproducing "
"publicity, not the spell card."
msgstr "好看，但你若只保存最好看的那一次，重現的是宣傳，不是符卡。"

#. spellReviewers.marisa.responses.object
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:144
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.marisa.responses.object"
msgid ""
"Sanding off every edge is not fairness; it means you have not chosen what to "
"perform. Give it one recognisable promise."
msgstr "把所有稜角磨掉不叫公平，叫還沒決定要表演什麼。給它一個能被認出的承諾。"

#. spellReviewers.aya.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:149
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.aya.name"
msgid "Aya Shameimaru"
msgstr "射命丸文"

#. spellReviewers.aya.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:150
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.aya.role"
msgid "Audience readability"
msgstr "觀眾可讀性"

#. spellReviewers.aya.responses.approve
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:152
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.aya.responses.approve"
msgid ""
"The first photograph explains the rule; only the second needs a headline. "
"Rare, and front-page material."
msgstr "第一張照片就能說明規則，第二張才需要標題。這很少見，值得頭版。"

#. spellReviewers.aya.responses.caution
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:153
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.aya.responses.caution"
msgid ""
"The participant understood. The audience saw only a beautiful escape. I need "
"a cue that does not rely on the caption afterward."
msgstr "參與者懂了，觀眾只看見一片漂亮的逃跑。我要一個不靠事後圖說的提示。"

#. spellReviewers.aya.responses.object
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:154
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.aya.responses.object"
msgid ""
"If the complete rule must fit in my headline, the picture has not reported "
"itself clearly."
msgstr "如果必須把完整規則塞進標題，畫面本身就還沒有報導清楚。"

#. spellReviewers.nitori.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:159
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.nitori.name"
msgid "Nitori Kawashiro"
msgstr "河城荷取"

#. spellReviewers.nitori.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:160
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.nitori.role"
msgid "Performance & collision stability"
msgstr "效能與碰撞穩定"

#. spellReviewers.nitori.responses.approve
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:162
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.nitori.responses.approve"
msgid ""
"Projectile count is within budget and the collision/display versions are "
"locked. It is stable if nobody touches the taped wire."
msgstr "彈數留在預算內，碰撞核和畫面版本也鎖好了。別碰那條有膠帶的線就很穩。"

#. spellReviewers.nitori.responses.caution
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:163
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.nitori.responses.caution"
msgid ""
"It runs now. Raise randomness and change rate together and the collision log "
"will arrive after the bullet."
msgstr "現在跑得動，但隨機幅度和變化頻率同時再加一格，碰撞記錄就會比彈幕晚到。"

#. spellReviewers.nitori.responses.object
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:164
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.nitori.responses.object"
msgid ""
"You are designing a spell card, not a device where frame rate becomes phase "
"two. Cut the count or lock the seed."
msgstr "你設計的是符卡，不是讓幀率自己成為第二階段。先砍彈數或鎖種子。"

#. spellReviewers.eirin.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:169
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.eirin.name"
msgid "Eirin Yagokoro"
msgstr "八意永琳"

#. spellReviewers.eirin.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:170
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.eirin.role"
msgid "Light, fatigue & stopping"
msgstr "光刺激、疲勞與停止"

#. spellReviewers.eirin.responses.approve
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:172
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.eirin.responses.approve"
msgid ""
"Stimulation, duration, and stop signal are predictable. This design can be "
"refused and left midway."
msgstr "刺激、時長和停止手勢都在可預期範圍。這是可以拒絕、也可以中途退出的設計。"

#. spellReviewers.eirin.responses.caution
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:173
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.eirin.responses.caution"
msgid ""
"One demonstration is possible. Repeated runs require rest, and closing one's "
"eyes cannot be the only safeguard."
msgstr "一次試演可以；連續場次必須加休息，且不能把閉眼當作唯一的安全措施。"

#. spellReviewers.eirin.responses.object
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:174
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.eirin.responses.object"
msgid ""
"A warning does not cancel excessive stimulation. Keep it in research "
"simulation; do not put people inside to prove it harmless."
msgstr "警告不會抵消過量刺激。可以留在研究模擬裡，不能把人帶進去證明它沒問題。"

#. spellReviewers.fairies.name
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:179
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.fairies.name"
msgid "Misty Lake Fairy Chorus"
msgstr "霧湖妖精合唱團"

#. spellReviewers.fairies.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:180
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.fairies.role"
msgid "Shared space, sound & play"
msgstr "共場、聲音與玩心"

#. spellReviewers.fairies.responses.approve
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:182
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.fairies.responses.approve"
msgid ""
"We can sing the second verse beside it, and Cirno found a route you did not "
"draw. That counts as fun."
msgstr "我們能在旁邊唱完第二段，而且琪露諾找到了一條你沒畫出來的路。算好玩。"

#. spellReviewers.fairies.responses.caution
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:183
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.fairies.responses.caution"
msgid ""
"We can follow the beat, but every shape change steals beat one. Leave us a "
"breath or let us strike the wooden cue."
msgstr "節拍能跟，但每次換形都搶走第一拍。要嘛留一口氣，要嘛讓我們負責敲木片。"

#. spellReviewers.fairies.responses.object
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:184
msgctxt "text:spellReviewers.fairies.responses.object"
msgid ""
"This is not a performance everyone can see; it freezes every sound nearby. "
"Even the strongest must leave rehearsal time."
msgstr "這不是『大家都能看見的表演』，是把旁邊所有聲音凍死。最強也要先留排練時間。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:194
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.role"
msgid "Question I · Is the exit still a rule?"
msgstr "第一問・退路是否仍是規則"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.prompt
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:195
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.prompt"
msgid ""
"After a change, the safe corridor is narrower than declared. What will you "
"make a rule that cannot change mid-performance?"
msgstr "變化後的安全走廊比宣言時更窄。你願意把哪一項寫成不可臨時更改的規則？"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.0.reserve.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:197
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.0.reserve.1"
msgid "Reserve the minimum corridor, even if symmetry breaks"
msgstr "保留最低走廊，即使破壞對稱"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.0.reserve.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:197
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.0.reserve.2"
msgid "Reimu gets a real exit; Marisa will ask you to explain the gap."
msgstr "靈夢得到明確退路；魔理沙會要求你解釋那個缺口。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.1.adaptive.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:198
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.1.adaptive.1"
msgid "Move the corridor, but precede every move with two cues"
msgstr "讓走廊移動，但每次先給雙重提示"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.1.adaptive.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:198
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.1.adaptive.2"
msgid "Keeps the variation while turning readability into a promise that must be tested."
msgstr "保留變化，也把可讀性變成必須驗證的承諾。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.2.advanced-only.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:199
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.2.advanced-only.1"
msgid "Keep the design and limit it to an advanced public session"
msgstr "保留設計，限定進階公開場"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.2.advanced-only.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:199
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.2.advanced-only.2"
msgid "Not everyone must participate, but the restriction must be visible before sign-up."
msgstr "不是所有人都必須參加，但限制必須在報名前可見。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.3.resolve-later.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:200
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.3.resolve-later.1"
msgid "Perform first; decide what counted as an exit after the incident"
msgstr "先演出，事故後再決定哪裡算出口"

#. spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.3.resolve-later.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:200
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.rule.choices.3.resolve-later.2"
msgid "Aya has already reserved the front page for this answer."
msgstr "文已經替這個答案留了頭版位置。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:205
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.role"
msgid "Question II · Can somebody else reproduce it?"
msgstr "第二問・別人能否重現"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.prompt
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:206
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.prompt"
msgid ""
"Your best test flight is beautiful. What will you publish so the next person "
"reproduces the design, not merely its publicity?"
msgstr "你的最好一次試飛非常漂亮。你要公開什麼，才能讓下一個人重現設計而不是只重播宣傳？"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.0.publish-seed.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:208
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.0.publish-seed.1"
msgid "Seed, parameters, collision version, and venue conditions"
msgstr "種子、參數、碰撞版本與場地條件"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.0.publish-seed.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:208
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.0.publish-seed.2"
msgid "Failed runs are included."
msgstr "失敗場次也一起列入。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.1.publish-rig.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:209
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.1.publish-rig.1"
msgid "Publish the rig and calibration, but keep the random seed"
msgstr "公開裝置與校準，但保留隨機種子"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.1.publish-rig.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:209
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.1.publish-rig.2"
msgid "Nitori can rebuild the machine, not guarantee the same sky."
msgstr "荷取能重建機器，不能保證重建同一張天空。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.2.best-video.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:210
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.2.best-video.1"
msgid "Publish only the best-looking recording"
msgstr "只公開最好看的錄像"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.2.best-video.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:210
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.2.best-video.2"
msgid "Aya gets a good story; the methods field stays blank."
msgstr "文得到一篇好報導；方法欄仍然空白。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.3.trade-secret.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:211
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.3.trade-secret.1"
msgid "Publish nothing; label it a magician's trade secret"
msgstr "都不公開，標成魔法使秘方"

#. spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.3.trade-secret.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:211
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.reproducibility.choices.3.trade-secret.2"
msgid "It may be performed, but not described as independently verified."
msgstr "可以表演，不能聲稱別人已驗證。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.aya.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:216
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.aya.role"
msgid "Question III · What did the audience see?"
msgstr "第三問・觀眾看見了什麼"

#. spellDefenceRounds.aya.prompt
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:217
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.aya.prompt"
msgid ""
"The participant read it at low speed; the audience photographed only light. "
"How do you show that the cue was not invented afterward?"
msgstr "參與者靠低速看懂了，觀眾只拍到一片光。你如何證明提示不是事後才被解釋出來？"

#. spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.0.audience-map.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:219
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.0.audience-map.1"
msgid "Publish a cue map without the solution before the performance"
msgstr "演出前公開一張不含答案的提示圖"

#. spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.0.audience-map.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:219
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.0.audience-map.2"
msgid "The audience knows where to look but must still read it."
msgstr "觀眾知道該看哪裡，但仍要自己讀。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.1.blind-coders.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:220
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.1.blind-coders.1"
msgid "Have design-blind observers independently mark cue timing"
msgstr "讓未看設計的人獨立標記提示時間"

#. spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.1.blind-coders.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:220
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.1.blind-coders.2"
msgid "The newspaper photograph becomes evidence, not judge."
msgstr "新聞照片成為資料之一，不是裁判。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.2.better-headline.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:221
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.2.better-headline.1"
msgid "Ask Aya to put the whole rule in the headline"
msgstr "請文把規則全部寫進標題"

#. spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.2.better-headline.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:221
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.aya.choices.2.better-headline.2"
msgid "The headline may hit readers before the danmaku does."
msgstr "標題可能比符卡先擊中讀者。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.nitori.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:226
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.nitori.role"
msgid "Question III · Is phase two just frame rate?"
msgstr "第三問・第二階段是不是幀率"

#. spellDefenceRounds.nitori.prompt
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:227
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.nitori.prompt"
msgid ""
"Under load, collision records trail the display by half a beat. What do you "
"sacrifice first?"
msgstr "壓力測試時，碰撞記錄比畫面晚半拍。你先犧牲什麼？"

#. spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.0.cap-budget.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:229
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.0.cap-budget.1"
msgid "Cap simultaneous shots and lock the collision version"
msgstr "限制同屏彈數並鎖定碰撞版本"

#. spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.0.cap-budget.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:229
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.0.cap-budget.2"
msgid "The picture loses a layer; the rule stays the same."
msgstr "畫面少一層，規則仍是同一張。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.1.lower-effects.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:230
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.1.lower-effects.1"
msgid "Keep trajectories; reduce afterimages and decoration first"
msgstr "保留彈路，先減少殘像與裝飾"

#. spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.1.lower-effects.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:230
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.1.lower-effects.2"
msgid "Aya dislikes the photograph; the participant avoids delayed collision."
msgstr "文會抱怨照片，參與者不會撞上延遲。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.2.more-tape.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:231
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.2.more-tape.1"
msgid "Add two strips of kappa tape and raise the alarm volume"
msgstr "加兩條河童膠帶並提高警報音量"

#. spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.2.more-tape.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:231
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.nitori.choices.2.more-tape.2"
msgid "Nitori asks the record to state that she did not recommend this."
msgstr "荷取要求記錄顯示：她沒有推薦這個答案。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.eirin.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:236
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.eirin.role"
msgid "Question III · Does a warning cancel stimulation?"
msgstr "第三問・警告能否抵消刺激"

#. spellDefenceRounds.eirin.prompt
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:237
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.eirin.prompt"
msgid ""
"Light load and duration exceed ordinary public conditions. How do you "
"preserve the research without using participants to prove it safe?"
msgstr "試演的光刺激與時長超出一般公開場條件。你如何保留研究，而不是拿參與者證明它安全？"

#. spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.0.closed-simulation.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:239
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.0.closed-simulation.1"
msgid "Move to closed simulation; preserve the design without public flight"
msgstr "改為封閉模擬，保留設計但不公開試飛"

#. spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.0.closed-simulation.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:239
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.0.closed-simulation.2"
msgid "Rejects public performance, not the research question."
msgstr "否決公開演出，不否決研究問題。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.1.short-session.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:240
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.1.short-session.1"
msgid "Shorten duration, reduce flashing, and provide exit/rest"
msgstr "縮短時長、降低閃爍並安排可離場休息"

#. spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.1.short-session.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:240
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.1.short-session.2"
msgid "Measure again after revision; do not reuse the old risk conclusion."
msgstr "修改後重新量測，不沿用舊風險結論。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.2.stronger-warning.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:241
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.2.stronger-warning.1"
msgid "Change nothing; make the warning larger"
msgstr "不修改，只把警告寫得更大"

#. spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.2.stronger-warning.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:241
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.eirin.choices.2.stronger-warning.2"
msgid "The warning still absorbs neither light nor fatigue."
msgstr "警告仍然不會吸收光或疲勞。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.fairies.role
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:246
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.fairies.role"
msgid "Question III · Is any sound left in the shared venue?"
msgstr "第三問・共用場地還剩多少聲音"

#. spellDefenceRounds.fairies.prompt
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:247
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.fairies.prompt"
msgid ""
"Alarm and change beats cover Misty Lake rehearsal. Whose time belongs inside "
"the spell-card rule?"
msgstr "警報和變化節拍蓋過霧湖排練。你把誰的時間算進符卡規則？"

#. spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.0.shared-count.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:249
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.0.shared-count.1"
msgid "Put chorus breaks and performance beats on one timeline"
msgstr "把合唱休息與演出節拍寫進同一張時序表"

#. spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.0.shared-count.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:249
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.0.shared-count.2"
msgid "Shared space stops being blank outside the design."
msgstr "共同場地不再被當作設計外的空白。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.1.wood-cue.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:250
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.1.wood-cue.1"
msgid "Replace the metal alarm with fairy-run wooden cues"
msgstr "取消金屬警報，由妖精負責木片提示"

#. spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.1.wood-cue.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:250
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.1.wood-cue.2"
msgid "Cues gain play; missed beats must enter version history."
msgstr "提示可能更有玩心，也必須把跑拍記進版本。"

#. spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.2.sing-louder.1
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:251
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.2.sing-louder.1"
msgid "Require the chorus to sing louder than the alarm"
msgstr "要求合唱團唱得比警報更大聲"

#. spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.2.sing-louder.2
#: src/data/spellcard-workshop.js:251
msgctxt "text:spellDefenceRounds.fairies.choices.2.sing-louder.2"
msgid "Cirno accepts the challenge. Medical review does not."
msgstr "琪露諾接受挑戰；醫療側沒有。"
